    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Golf Pro Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/fb680758143c94dbeecddc46ee0085b2.avif?t=1754395481\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf Pro Simulator lets you step onto the green, line up your shot, and feel the thrill of a perfect swing. Enjoy a relaxing day under the sun, challenge friends in local multiplayer, and master different clubs to climb the leaderboard. Time to hit the fairway!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/771ffd5b8834d34b8edd45b4303f60ce.webp?t=1754395481\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/0d0ded1c7a429739ae795f644b99185a.poster.avif?t=1754395481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/0d0ded1c7a429739ae795f644b99185a.webm?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/0d0ded1c7a429739ae795f644b99185a.mp4?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Golf Pro Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the course and experience the thrill of realistic golf in Golf Pro Simulator. Choose your golfer, grab your clubs, and perfect your swing across beautifully designed courses. Whether you're aiming for precision or just enjoying a casual round, every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/c43b1cc6826fac1ae799d634d0f29b8d.webp?t=1754395481\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/e53fa6878406d8eb513659e04b8a79fa.poster.avif?t=1754395481\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/e53fa6878406d8eb513659e04b8a79fa.webm?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/e53fa6878406d8eb513659e04b8a79fa.mp4?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or challenge friends in local multiplayer, competing for the best score. Customize your golfer, master different clubs, and work your way up the leaderboard. With upcoming tournaments, achievements, and more courses on the horizon, the fairway is just the beginning!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf Pro Simulator lets you step onto the green, line up your shot, and feel the thrill of a perfect swing. Enjoy a relaxing day under the sun, challenge friends in local multiplayer, and master different clubs to climb the leaderboard. Time to hit the fairway!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/771ffd5b8834d34b8edd45b4303f60ce.webp?t=1754395481\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/0d0ded1c7a429739ae795f644b99185a.poster.avif?t=1754395481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/0d0ded1c7a429739ae795f644b99185a.webm?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/0d0ded1c7a429739ae795f644b99185a.mp4?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Golf Pro Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the course and experience the thrill of realistic golf in Golf Pro Simulator. Choose your golfer, grab your clubs, and perfect your swing across beautifully designed courses. Whether you're aiming for precision or just enjoying a casual round, every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/c43b1cc6826fac1ae799d634d0f29b8d.webp?t=1754395481\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/e53fa6878406d8eb513659e04b8a79fa.poster.avif?t=1754395481\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/e53fa6878406d8eb513659e04b8a79fa.webm?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514580/extras/e53fa6878406d8eb513659e04b8a79fa.mp4?t=1754395481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or challenge friends in local multiplayer, competing for the best score. Customize your golfer, master different clubs, and work your way up the leaderboard. With upcoming tournaments, achievements, and more courses on the horizon, the fairway is just the beginning!</p>",
